  "organizationGenerationPrompt": "- Apply the latest corrections and exclusions to the original first, then use the concrete edits within the scope of the user’s request. Skip unconfirmed new information and unanswered details. If no direction was given, edit lightly or retain the original if suitable.\n- Preserve language, perspective, wording, attribution, relative dates, and uncertainty. Remove only filler or repetition and move content as requested. Add only information the user supplied or confirmed. Convert dates only when requested and well grounded.\n- Mark explicit tasks \"- [ ]\" and confirmed completed tasks \"- [x]\". Keep experiences and tentative plans in prose. Do not add deadlines, steps, or priorities. Use blank lines between natural paragraphs and flat lists only where needed. Keep existing subheadings as ordinary text when useful. Omit a new title, emphasis, tables, separators, HTML, math, and code fences.",
